    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791300/extras/608787f3e98b5cb330dacebbf6974eb9.poster.avif?t=1711329497\" width=620 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791300/extras/608787f3e98b5cb330dacebbf6974eb9.webm?t=1711329497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791300/extras/608787f3e98b5cb330dacebbf6974eb9.mp4?t=1711329497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Morph is a casual indie game that allows you to play in a variety of styles, such as 'possessing' over 100 different objects in a given world to find and chase other players, or quietly hiding.<br><br><strong><u>Possess yourself with another object!</u></strong><br>Possess with a variety of objects to blend in perfectly with your surroundings to hide your presence and strategically gain a tactical advantage.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791300/extras/c0b1b7f590d67185f82dfec16a9265e0.poster.avif?t=1711329497\" width=720 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791300/extras/c0b1b7f590d67185f82dfec16a9265e0.webm?t=1711329497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791300/extras/c0b1b7f590d67185f82dfec16a9265e0.mp4?t=1711329497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>Find other players!</u></strong><br>Find, chase, and slay other players.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791300/extras/89820f54f45e441e345403e3f7c4d03a.poster.avif?t=1711329497\" width=720 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791300/extras/89820f54f45e441e345403e3f7c4d03a.webm?t=1711329497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791300/extras/89820f54f45e441e345403e3f7c4d03a.mp4?t=1711329497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>Hide naturally!</u></strong><br>Hide your possessed object inconspicuously by blending it seamlessly into its environment.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791300/extras/12e340c780104a1b484b07c89ff22e65.poster.avif?t=1711329497\" width=720 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791300/extras/12e340c780104a1b484b07c89ff22e65.webm?t=1711329497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791300/extras/12e340c780104a1b484b07c89ff22e65.mp4?t=1711329497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>Use your skills!</u></strong><br>Create your own play style by combining various skills and enjoy the game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791300/extras/c0c83e2cf9b552ab393812dc890866dc.poster.avif?t=1711329497\" width=720 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791300/extras/c0c83e2cf9b552ab393812dc890866dc.webm?t=1711329497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791300/extras/c0c83e2cf9b552ab393812dc890866dc.mp4?t=1711329497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>Play with variety maps!</u></strong><br>Enjoy the game using numerous objects on maps of various concepts.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791300/extras/a8ab8e07403d67f0c65fa5e9b7070fec.poster.avif?t=1711329497\" width=720 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791300/extras/a8ab8e07403d67f0c65fa5e9b7070fec.webm?t=1711329497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791300/extras/a8ab8e07403d67f0c65fa5e9b7070fec.mp4?t=1711329497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
